{"corpus":"ccc","number":304,"text_html":"<span>Ainsi voit-on l’Esprit Saint, auteur principal de l’Écriture Sainte, attribuer souvent des actions à Dieu, sans mentionner des causes secondes. Ce n’est pas là « une façon de parler » primitive, mais une manière profonde de rappeler la primauté de Dieu et sa Seigneurie absolue sur l’histoire et le monde <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup> et d’éduquer ainsi à la confiance<sup class=\"srcRef cccRef\">§2568</sup> en Lui. La prière des Psaumes est la grande école de cette confiance <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"5\">2</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":["2568"],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Is 10:5-15"},{"text":"Is 45:5-7"},{"text":"Dt 32:39"},{"text":"Si 11:14"},{"text":"Ps 22"},{"text":"Ps 32"},{"text":"Ps 35"},{"text":"Ps 103"},{"text":"Ps 138"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Is 10:5-15","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"45:5-7","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Dt 32:39","idx":3,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Si 11:14","idx":4,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ps 22","idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"32","idx":6,"marker_idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"35","idx":7,"marker_idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"103","idx":8,"marker_idx":5,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"138","idx":9,"marker_idx":5,"display_idx":2}]}